---

### Step 2: Update the File on GitHub

1. On your GitHub page, locate the **pencil icon** (✏️) in the top-right area above the README box (next to the trash icon) and click it to edit.
2. Select all existing text in the editor box and paste the new code above over it.
3. Scroll down or look at the top right, click the green **Commit changes...** button, and confirm by clicking **Commit changes**.
